# The loop, more: PULSE's hits loop with VOX's notes; PLAY held with ALGO: half speed, double (no undo
# then); the loop follows the scene (its notes are the key's degrees: a new scene, the same tune in its
# key); it is saved, and after a power cut it is back, playing when the clock starts.
autoplay 0
wait 300
tap REC
wait 100
tapkey b5
wait 600
key w0 down
wait 600
key w0 up
wait 1500
tap REC
wait 100
expect looper 2
expect looplen 16
expect kicks 1
wait 2800
expect kicks 2
press PLAY
wait 200
turn ALGO -1
wait 800
release PLAY
wait 100
expect layers 1
expect looper 2
shot loop_half.png
expect vox_notes >-1
wait 5600
expect kicks 3
press PLAY
turn ALGO 2
release PLAY
wait 100
expect layers 1
turn PRESET 1
wait 13000
expect scene 2
expect vox_notes >0
tap SAVE
expect dirty 0
powercut
wait 500
expect looper 2
expect layers 1
expect looplen 16
expect playing 0
expect vox_notes >-1
tap SEQ
wait 3000
expect vox_notes >0
expect clips 0
